[00:17.66]1. Young man and young woman,
[00:21.16]do give your heart to me.
[00:24.66]My foe who now taunts me
[00:28.66]will then be made to see.
[00:33.02]Your youth and devotion
[00:37.72]to me you freely give;
[00:38.82]You show all the world
[00:39.92]that for me you really live.
[00:44.82](Chorus)
[00:49.72]Beloved son and precious daughter,
[00:56.72]Be wise and make my heart rejoice,
[01:04.70]That out of your own heart you serve me,
[01:12.09]And offer praise by your own choice.
[01:31.10]2. Rejoice and take pleasure
[01:34.60]in giving me your all,
[01:38.10]And though you may stumble,
[01:41.60]I’ll raise you if you fall.
[01:45.10]No matter who fails you
[01:47.77]or proves to be untrue,
[01:50.43]Take comfort in knowing
[01:53.08]I’ll always cherish you.
[01:57.58](Chorus)
[02:02.58]Beloved son and precious daughter,
[02:10.27]Be wise and make my heart rejoice,
[02:17.27]That out of your own heart you serve me,
[02:24.27]And offer praise by your own choice.